# treemgr mountpoint for the state container.
#
# Mounts a fresh RAM-backed handler at `state.*` so the schema mirror rule has
# somewhere to publish the operational copy of every `state = true` config leaf.
# Drop this file into the agent's treemgr maps directory (next to agentconfig.map
# and ramstore.map) and `treemgr.build` will compile it into the CDB mapping.
#
# Format: first line is `treemgr <handler_module>`; the following lines map a
# logical path to a handler path. An empty handler path mounts the whole handler.

treemgr agent.treemgr.handlers.ramstore
state=
